OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled after bedbugs
OL,4,Afound on board
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of train services were
OL,7,Fcancelled after drivers discovered
OL,8,Fbedbugs in their cabs.
OL,10,FCarriages on two affected trains were
OL,11,Flocked to isolate passenger areas from
OL,12,Fthe cabs, said Southeastern, which
OL,13,Foperates services in Kent, East Sussex
OL,14,Fand Greater London.
OL,16,FThe rail firm said the trains only
OL,17,Fremained in service while they
OL,18,F"returned to a suitable location for
OL,19,Finspection and if necessary,
OL,20,Ftreatment".
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
