OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled after bedbugs
OL,4,Afound on board
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cancellations took place on
OL,7,Fmainline routes after the bugs were
OL,8,Fspotted on 22 September. None of the
OL,9,Finsects were found on any High Speed 1
OL,10,Ftrains, it added.
